    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {7.4 \\times {{10}^4}} \\right) \\times \\left( {4.8 \\times {{10}^3}} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 1: Multiply the number parts.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"7.4 \\times 4.8 = 35.52\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 2: Add the exponents of the 10s.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"4 + 3 = 7\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 3: The result is the answer from Step 1 times 10 raised to the answer from Step 2.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"35.52 \\times {10^7}\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 4: If the answer is not in scientific notation, adjust it.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"3.552 \\times {10^8}\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
